WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.137 --> 00:00:15.398
have to get to City Hall," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:17.119 --> 00:00:18.459
She rushed back to her friends.

3
00:00:18.479 --> 00:00:23.342
"Hey, guys, I just remembered something.

4
00:00:24.402 --> 00:00:27.123
I have to uh do a book report.

5
00:00:27.384 --> 00:00:27.884
See you later!"

6
00:00:32.196 --> 00:00:33.817
Terrell watched Roxy run away.

7
00:00:33.837 --> 00:00:36.559
"That's weird," he thought.

8
00:00:36.579 --> 00:00:39.662
"Our teacher didn't assign a book report."

9
00:00:41.783 --> 00:00:43.145
Roxy arrived at City Hall.

10
00:00:44.205 --> 00:00:46.707
Detective Smith was talking to Mayor Bloom's assistant.

11
00:00:48.068 --> 00:00:53.132
and after that," the assistant was saying, "Mayor Bloom ran out of City Hall."

12
00:00:54.433 --> 00:00:57.736
"I wonder why he stole the money," said Detective Smith.

13
00:00:59.624 --> 00:01:03.287
"Maybe Mayor Bloom was going to buy a new assistant," said Roxy.

14
00:01:04.468 --> 00:01:05.689
She glared at the assistant.

15
00:01:05.709 --> 00:01:07.951
"I think you're lying.

16
00:01:08.732 --> 00:01:10.213
Mayor Bloom is not a thief."

17
00:01:11.134 --> 00:01:12.175
The assistant frowned.

18
00:01:12.195 --> 00:01:15.338
"I am not lying," she said.

19
00:01:15.358 --> 00:01:18.300
"I'm as surprised as you are by this."

20
00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:22.544
"Ahem," said Detective Smith, looking at Roxy.

21
00:01:22.564 --> 00:01:25.786
"Arguing won't help, Rocket Girl."

22
00:01:26.707 --> 00:01:27.528
Roxy sighed.

23
00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:29.820
"You're right.

24
00:01:31.261 --> 00:01:32.421
Do you know where the mayor went?

25
00:01:33.261 --> 00:01:34.621
Did he leave any clues?"

26
00:01:36.022 --> 00:01:37.542
"No," said the assistant.

27
00:01:37.562 --> 00:01:41.023
"But he got a mysterious phone call before he took the money."

28
00:01:41.043 --> 00:01:42.864
"Who called him?"

29
00:01:43.204 --> 00:01:44.144
asked Detective Smith.

30
00:01:47.465 --> 00:01:49.105
The assistant checked the mayor's phone.

31
00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:55.127
"The call came from the lab at Metro City University."

32
00:01:55.147 --> 00:01:58.428
"Okay, Rocket Girl," said Detective Smith.

33
00:01:59.328 --> 00:02:01.750
"We need to go to the—Rocket Girl?"

34
00:02:06.433 --> 00:02:08.915
Roxy arrived at the Metro City University lab.

35
00:02:12.837 --> 00:02:14.879
Two large booths stood along one wall.

36
00:02:15.799 --> 00:02:18.621
Wires and coils connected the booths to a big computer.

37
00:02:19.862 --> 00:02:21.483
A man sat in front of the computer.

38
00:02:22.344 --> 00:02:24.285
He had black hair and thick glasses.

39
00:02:24.305 --> 00:02:28.208
"I was expecting you, Rocket Girl," said the man.

40
00:02:29.224 --> 00:02:30.866
"You must be looking for Mayor Bloom."

41
00:02:30.886 --> 00:02:32.987
"Who are you?"

42
00:02:33.348 --> 00:02:34.028
asked Roxy.

43
00:02:36.991 --> 00:02:38.011
The man smiled.

44
00:02:38.031 --> 00:02:39.753
"I'm Professor Ditto."

45
00:02:41.054 --> 00:02:42.675
Roxy heard a footstep behind her.

46
00:02:43.816 --> 00:02:45.758
She spun around and saw another man.

47
00:02:46.819 --> 00:02:48.240
He looked just like the first one.

48
00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:52.043
"I'm Professor Ditto too," said the new man.

49
00:02:54.345 --> 00:02:55.566
Another man entered the lab.

50
00:02:55.586 --> 00:02:57.588
"And so am I."

51
00:02:58.928 --> 00:03:00.309
Roxy blinked in surprise.

52
00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:02.971
That man was followed by more men.

53
00:03:03.912 --> 00:03:05.333
Every one of them looked the same.

54
00:03:05.353 --> 00:03:08.255
"They're all Professor Ditto!"

55
00:03:08.515 --> 00:03:09.216
thought Roxy.

56
00:03:10.517 --> 00:03:11.878
The men moved toward Roxy.

57
00:03:13.519 --> 00:03:14.720
She took a few steps back.

58
00:03:18.903 --> 00:03:21.305
Suddenly the professors pushed her into one of the booths.

59
00:03:23.366 --> 00:03:25.248
Roxy yelled as the door slammed shut.

60
00:03:28.648 --> 00:03:29.749
Electricity hummed.

61
00:03:30.549 --> 00:03:31.630
Bright lights flashed.

62
00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:33.231
Sparks flew.

63
00:03:34.711 --> 00:03:35.912
Then the lab was quiet.

64
00:03:37.233 --> 00:03:38.693
Roxy was taken out of her booth.

65
00:03:41.935 --> 00:03:43.056
She looked at the other booth.

66
00:03:44.556 --> 00:03:45.617
Someone stepped out of it.

67
00:03:47.778 --> 00:03:48.739
Roxy gasped.

68
00:03:49.579 --> 00:03:51.040
It was another Rocket Girl!
